<dt>Sent when:
<dd>the player clicks on a destination in the world map
<dt>Sent from:
<dd><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Engine" title="Engine (page does not exist)">engine</a>
<dt>Sent to:
